# The look finds the row; a stream gives states, a gap, levels, an object in three chunks;
# two frames that fail their check ask for a new search; a palette that cannot be told apart
# asks for depth 2; another session; a clean end; output that is not frames; a stream that
# fails with its exit code; then no list of the displays.
# args: --json --record RECORD --remember PLACE --display
list 0 2560 4
stream 1
stream 1 2 +0.7 2 3:health=0.5 3 4:obj=0 4:obj=0 4:obj=0 5:obj=1 5:obj=1 5:obj=1 6:obj=2 6:obj=2 6:obj=2 7 +1.2 8 9:bad 9:bad hold
list 0 2560 4
stream blank
stream 10
stream 10 11:crush 12:crush 13:crush 14:crush 15:session=4712 16:session=4712 17:session=4712:crush 18:session=4712:crush
list 0 2560 4
stream 19
stream 19 20 blank blank hold
list 1 1280 200
stream 21
stream 21 22 junk
list 0 2560 4
stream 23
stream 23 24 exit=5
